1
00:00:22,397 --> 00:00:24,816
Okey. Bagaimana keadaannya?

2
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:26,818
VRI untuk pesakit pekak dah sampai.

3
00:00:26,902 --> 00:00:28,403
JAM KELAPAN
1.00 - 2.00 PETANG

4
00:00:28,487 --> 00:00:29,863
Bayi Doe, tunggu pediatrik.

5
00:00:29,947 --> 00:00:31,865
Tengah 6 stabil dengan IV insulin.

6
00:00:31,949 --> 00:00:34,117
Pesakit Westbridge
masih tunggu giliran

7
00:00:34,201 --> 00:00:36,036
berjam-jam di koridor.

8
00:00:36,119 --> 00:00:37,788
Awak memang luar biasa.

9
00:00:37,871 --> 00:00:39,122
Layak naik gaji?

10
00:00:39,206 --> 00:00:40,916
Layak dapat lebih kasih sayang saya.

11
00:00:40,999 --> 00:00:42,334
Cukuplah.

12
00:00:43,001 --> 00:00:44,836
Pesakit serangan seksual di triaj.

13
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,922
PAAR dihubungi, wakilnya akan datang.

14
00:00:47,005 --> 00:00:48,340
Okey. Kami akan uruskan.

15
00:00:49,967 --> 00:00:52,427
Dr. McKay,
apa status pesakit di Tengah 9?

16
00:00:52,511 --> 00:00:53,512
Dah boleh discaj?

17
00:00:53,595 --> 00:00:56,723
Ya, tapi dia nak tinggal
di hospital sekarang

18
00:00:56,807 --> 00:00:58,100
sebab dalam kesakitan.

19
00:00:58,183 --> 00:01:00,143
Di tempat yang sesak dan bising

20
00:01:00,227 --> 00:01:02,396
dengan banyak
kes Westbridge akan tiba?

21
00:01:02,479 --> 00:01:03,897
Lebih selesa di rumah.

22
00:01:04,481 --> 00:01:05,816
<i>Debrief</i> awak tadi bagus.

23
00:01:07,526 --> 00:01:08,527
Terima kasih.

24
00:01:09,444 --> 00:01:11,446
Boleh bantu Dana
periksa mangsa seksual

25
00:01:11,530 --> 00:01:13,115
- yang baru masuk?
- Ya.

26
00:01:13,699 --> 00:01:16,159
Apa kata kita cuba
yakinkan pesakit awak?

27
00:01:16,243 --> 00:01:19,371
Saya nak uruskan
pesakit serangan seksual di triaj.

28
00:01:19,454 --> 00:01:21,248
Salah seorang perlu jaga di sini.

29
00:01:21,331 --> 00:01:23,208
- Kita boleh panggil SANE.
- Waktu ini?

30
00:01:23,292 --> 00:01:25,794
Pasti lambat.
Tak boleh buat pesakit menunggu.

31
00:01:25,877 --> 00:01:27,504
Disebabkan hanya saya ahli SANE...

32
00:01:27,588 --> 00:01:28,714
Princess akan jaga.

33
00:01:29,923 --> 00:01:33,302
Hei! Jangan ajar dia tabiat tak baik.

34
00:01:33,385 --> 00:01:34,553
Mari sini.

35
00:01:34,636 --> 00:01:35,971
- Sedia, doktor?
- Ya.

36
00:01:36,054 --> 00:01:38,890
SANE bermaksud
Jururawat Pemeriksa Serangan Seksual.

37
00:01:38,974 --> 00:01:41,184
Buat pemeriksaan forensik,
kumpul bukti

38
00:01:41,268 --> 00:01:43,729
dan serahkan kepada polis
jika laporan dibuat.

39
00:01:43,812 --> 00:01:47,357
Kita juga berikan sumber,
sokongan dan kadangkala testimoni.

40
00:01:47,441 --> 00:01:48,358
Pergi mahkamah?

41
00:01:48,442 --> 00:01:51,111
SANE amat berharga di hospital,
terutama di kecemasan.

42
00:01:51,194 --> 00:01:52,946
Lebih ramai jururawat patut dilatih.

43
00:01:53,030 --> 00:01:54,948
Dia serius tentangnya.

44
00:02:03,290 --> 00:02:05,292
Tempat ini makin sesak.

45
00:02:05,375 --> 00:02:06,877
Makin teruk nanti.

46
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:08,712
Ada berita tentang Westbridge?

47
00:02:08,795 --> 00:02:11,757
- Taruhan saya $20, masalah serangga.
- Tiada berita.

48
00:02:12,299 --> 00:02:14,926
Nampaknya Pasport Pesakit
ada kegunaan lain.

49
00:02:15,761 --> 00:02:17,179
Di mana mangsa?

50
00:02:17,262 --> 00:02:19,598
- Di triaj, Ruang 2.
- Terima kasih, Lupe.

51
00:02:20,807 --> 00:02:22,267
- Ini maklumatnya.
- Baiklah.

52
00:02:29,900 --> 00:02:33,236
Hai, Cik Miller. Saya Dana.

53
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:34,863
Bagaimana keadaan awak?

54
00:02:34,946 --> 00:02:37,407
- Dulu lebih baik.
- Ya.

55
00:02:37,491 --> 00:02:38,950
Sekarang awak di tempat selamat.

56
00:02:39,034 --> 00:02:42,704
Saya bertugas di sini dan
Jururawat Pemeriksa Serangan Seksual.

57
00:02:42,788 --> 00:02:44,581
Ini Emma yang akan bantu saya.

58
00:02:44,665 --> 00:02:46,083
Saya Dr. Al-Hashimi.

59
00:02:46,166 --> 00:02:49,169
Saya akan periksa sebarang
kecederaan yang perlu dirawat.

60
00:02:50,629 --> 00:02:53,382
Panggil saya Ilana. Saya tak cedera.

61
00:02:53,465 --> 00:02:54,800
Okey, bagus.

62
00:02:54,883 --> 00:02:56,510
Kami akan sediakan bilik.

63
00:02:56,593 --> 00:02:58,970
Sementara itu,
Dr. Al-Hashimi akan tanya soalan.

64
00:02:59,054 --> 00:03:00,514
Berapa lama?

65
00:03:01,306 --> 00:03:04,559
Saya tak boleh berjanji,
tapi kami akan buat secepatnya.

66
00:03:05,727 --> 00:03:07,145
- Terima kasih.
- Ya.

67
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:14,403
Ilana, awak makan apa-apa ubat?

68
00:03:14,486 --> 00:03:16,488
Hanya Synthroid, sebiji sehari.

69
00:03:16,571 --> 00:03:19,950
- Okey. Ada alahan ubat?
- Tiada.

70
00:03:20,033 --> 00:03:22,661
Dana akan bawa awak
apabila bilik dah sedia

71
00:03:22,744 --> 00:03:24,746
dan saya akan kembali periksa awak.

72
00:03:31,837 --> 00:03:33,880
- Panggil saya selepas tukar pakaian.
- Ya.

73
00:03:34,548 --> 00:03:36,800
Kita guna Bilik Pemeriksaan 1 dan 2.

74
00:03:36,883 --> 00:03:39,678
Bilik paling privasi
dan jauh dari kecemasan.

75
00:03:40,512 --> 00:03:42,472
Kerja ini agak berat. Awak sedia?

76
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:46,476
Ya. Saya okey.

77
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:48,395
Beritahu kalau nak berundur.

78
00:03:56,194 --> 00:03:57,404
Ya.

79
00:04:00,365 --> 00:04:01,408
Dr. Ellis.

80
00:04:01,491 --> 00:04:03,452
- Alamak.
- Ya.

81
00:04:03,535 --> 00:04:06,830
Saya perlukan bilik ini.
Tolong cari tempat lain untuk tidur.

82
00:04:06,913 --> 00:04:08,874
Tidur 20 minit pun tak boleh?

83
00:04:09,666 --> 00:04:11,126
Syif mula 1.30 petang. Saya...

84
00:04:11,209 --> 00:04:13,086
Tak boleh. Kita ambil kes Westbridge.

85
00:04:13,170 --> 00:04:15,172
Ruang menunggu sesak.
Awak tak nampak?

86
00:04:15,255 --> 00:04:18,216
- Tak, saya tak ikut situ.
- Okey.

87
00:04:19,176 --> 00:04:20,010
Ya.

88
00:04:20,886 --> 00:04:21,970
Staf tidur di sini?

89
00:04:22,053 --> 00:04:24,181
Ya, doktor syif malam perlu berehat,

90
00:04:24,264 --> 00:04:26,224
lagi-lagi jika terpaksa datang siang.

91
00:04:26,308 --> 00:04:28,351
Tapi hari ini tak cukup tempat.

92
00:04:28,435 --> 00:04:30,854
Tolong ambilkan bangku beroda

93
00:04:30,937 --> 00:04:33,231
dan Esme untuk sediakan.

94
00:04:36,485 --> 00:04:39,529
Jadi, awak sakit kepala dan abdomen.

95
00:04:43,658 --> 00:04:44,659
<i>Ya, betul.</i>

96
00:04:44,743 --> 00:04:46,912
Okey, yang mana lebih sakit?

97
00:04:51,583 --> 00:04:54,795
<i>Sakit kepala saya teruk
minggu lepas, tapi sekarang...</i>

98
00:04:56,296 --> 00:04:57,380
Hei, tak jelas.

99
00:04:57,464 --> 00:04:59,549
- Boleh ulang lagi?
<i>- Okey.</i>

100
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:06,014
<i>Sakit kepala saya teruk minggu lepas,</i>

101
00:05:06,097 --> 00:05:08,475
<i>tapi abdomen saya sekarang...</i>

102
00:05:09,351 --> 00:05:11,436
Demi Tuhan. Tak guna betul...

103
00:05:12,771 --> 00:05:13,897
Tak guna.

104
00:05:24,658 --> 00:05:27,828
MAAF, SAYA AKAN KEMBALI
KAMI AKAN BUAT IMBASAN CT

105
00:05:28,995 --> 00:05:30,038
<i>Kenapa?</i>

106
00:05:38,255 --> 00:05:39,714
UNTUK BERJAGA-JAGA!

107
00:05:41,341 --> 00:05:43,426
Saya akan kembali.

108
00:05:44,261 --> 00:05:45,262
Maaf.

109
00:05:52,310 --> 00:05:54,813
Dr. Al-Hashimi.
Ibu bapa Jackson sampai.

110
00:05:54,896 --> 00:05:56,523
Okey, saya uruskan.

111
00:05:57,858 --> 00:06:01,403
En. dan Pn. Davis,
doktor penyelia saya, Dr. Al-Hashimi.

112
00:06:01,486 --> 00:06:02,529
Hai, salam kenal.

113
00:06:02,612 --> 00:06:04,364
- Demi.
- Charles.

114
00:06:05,031 --> 00:06:06,491
Apa yang berlaku?

115
00:06:06,575 --> 00:06:07,951
Dia macam tak sedar.

116
00:06:08,034 --> 00:06:11,204
Jackson kepenatan
sebab sedatif yang kami beri.

117
00:06:11,288 --> 00:06:12,330
Sedatif?

118
00:06:12,414 --> 00:06:14,624
Anak puan resah semasa tiba.

119
00:06:14,708 --> 00:06:15,959
Memanglah, dia direnjat.

120
00:06:16,042 --> 00:06:18,253
Kenapa mereka renjat dia?

121
00:06:18,336 --> 00:06:21,006
Mengarut. Kami nak bawa dia balik.

122
00:06:21,089 --> 00:06:22,799
Apa kata kita keluar sekejap?

123
00:06:31,766 --> 00:06:34,811
Sekarang, Jackson ditahan
bawah pemerhatian psikologi.

124
00:06:34,895 --> 00:06:36,730
Apa? Itu tak perlu.

125
00:06:36,813 --> 00:06:38,356
Dia hanya perlu berehat.

126
00:06:38,440 --> 00:06:41,568
Dia ulang kaji untuk ujian guaman.
Kami boleh jaga.

127
00:06:41,651 --> 00:06:43,236
Ujiannya tiada masalah,

128
00:06:43,320 --> 00:06:45,530
tapi Jackson mengadu dengar bisikan.

129
00:06:46,489 --> 00:06:47,866
Mungkin hal serius.

130
00:06:47,949 --> 00:06:50,076
Dr. Jefferson akan jumpa kamu.

131
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:53,038
Dia boleh jelaskan lagi
tentang situasi Jackson.

132
00:06:53,121 --> 00:06:56,625
- Siapa Dr. Jefferson?
- Doktor psikiatri. Dia bagus.

133
00:06:56,708 --> 00:06:58,835
Dia boleh jelaskan
dan jawab soalan kamu.

134
00:06:58,919 --> 00:07:01,296
Javadi, apa kata
bawa mereka ke bilik keluarga?

135
00:07:01,379 --> 00:07:02,756
- Okey.
- Saya minta diri.

136
00:07:02,839 --> 00:07:04,049
Ikut sini.

137
00:07:26,071 --> 00:07:28,740
<i>Anda hubungi
Kumpulan Neurosains Pittsburgh.</i>

138
00:07:28,823 --> 00:07:33,620
<i>Jika ini kecemasan perubatan,
sila hubungi 911.</i>

139
00:07:33,703 --> 00:07:36,790
<i>Untuk alamat pejabat
dan waktu operasi, tekan satu.</i>

140
00:07:36,873 --> 00:07:39,417
<i>Untuk pengisian ubat, tekan dua.</i>

141
00:07:39,501 --> 00:07:42,003
<i>Untuk tinggalkan pesanan
kepada doktor...</i>

142
00:07:43,838 --> 00:07:47,968
Hai, saya Dr. Al-Hashimi.
Saya pesakit Dr. Fairgraves.

143
00:07:48,051 --> 00:07:50,178
Saya nak bercakap kalau dia ada.

144
00:07:52,263 --> 00:07:55,100
Jika tiada,
saya nak buat janji temu terdekat.

145
00:07:55,183 --> 00:07:58,937
Hubungi saya jika ada slot lapang.
Terima kasih.

146
00:08:00,397 --> 00:08:02,607
Macam saya kata,
awak boleh duduk di sini

147
00:08:02,691 --> 00:08:04,734
sehingga ada katil wad kosong.

148
00:08:04,818 --> 00:08:09,197
Tapi boleh jadi beberapa hari
atau lebih lama.

149
00:08:10,573 --> 00:08:13,326
Kawasan ini juga bising
dan awak tak dapat rehat.

150
00:08:13,410 --> 00:08:17,163
Di rumah, awak dapat bersama
keluarga dan lebih selesa.

151
00:08:18,790 --> 00:08:20,458
Terpulang pada awak, Roxie.

152
00:08:23,169 --> 00:08:25,922
Bukannya saya tak nak balik, tapi...

153
00:08:26,006 --> 00:08:28,091
- Hai, mak.
- Mak.

154
00:08:28,174 --> 00:08:31,219
Lena mesej saya.
Alang-alang, saya bawa mereka.

155
00:08:32,095 --> 00:08:34,264
Bagaimana? Semuanya baik?

156
00:08:34,347 --> 00:08:37,892
Robbie, kes trauma,
pegawai polis akan datang.

157
00:08:37,976 --> 00:08:39,310
Saya datang.

158
00:08:39,394 --> 00:08:41,855
Saya akan kembali.
Kamu berbuallah dulu.

159
00:08:44,941 --> 00:08:46,651
Okey. Silakan duduk.

160
00:08:54,993 --> 00:08:56,995
Awak perlukan apa-apa?

161
00:09:02,292 --> 00:09:04,085
Awak mengawal keadaan ini, Ilana.

162
00:09:05,170 --> 00:09:06,921
Kami bantu dan sokong awak.

163
00:09:07,797 --> 00:09:11,259
Sebaik buka kit ini,
saya tak boleh keluar.

164
00:09:11,342 --> 00:09:15,305
Tapi kalau awak perlukan ruang,
beritahu kami, okey?

165
00:09:15,388 --> 00:09:17,515
Emma boleh teman awak.

166
00:09:18,224 --> 00:09:20,435
Wakil Gerakan Antirogol Pittsburgh

167
00:09:20,518 --> 00:09:22,187
sudah dihubungi dan akan tiba.

168
00:09:22,270 --> 00:09:24,314
- Boleh kita mulakan?
- Ya.

169
00:09:24,397 --> 00:09:27,901
Saya akan pakai topeng muka
agar tak cemarkan apa-apa.

170
00:09:27,984 --> 00:09:29,903
Emma pun dah pakai.

171
00:09:30,987 --> 00:09:34,908
Sekarang, untuk pemeriksaan
dibuat oleh doktor,

172
00:09:34,991 --> 00:09:36,159
pakai gaun hospital.

173
00:09:36,242 --> 00:09:38,745
Saya perlu ambil
pakaian awak dulu. Okey?

174
00:09:43,750 --> 00:09:46,753
Tolong tanggalkan pakaian
di atas pelapik ini.

175
00:09:46,836 --> 00:09:49,672
Letak setiap satu di atasnya.

176
00:09:49,756 --> 00:09:52,425
Kemudian, kami akan asingkannya.

177
00:09:53,426 --> 00:09:55,762
- Kami akan beri pakaian baharu.
- Baiklah.

178
00:09:55,845 --> 00:09:58,848
Emma tunggu di sebalik tirai,
saya akan bersama awak.

179
00:10:00,517 --> 00:10:02,268
Tanggalkan kasut dulu.

180
00:10:03,812 --> 00:10:07,232
Selepas siap,
tolong pakai gaun hospital,

181
00:10:08,316 --> 00:10:09,567
biar terbuka di belakang.

182
00:10:36,052 --> 00:10:37,720
Bagaimana jika dia tak nak balik?

183
00:10:37,804 --> 00:10:39,973
Dia kena tahan dengan kita.

184
00:10:42,058 --> 00:10:44,727
Tak dapat bayangkan. Anak-anaknya...

185
00:10:44,811 --> 00:10:45,979
Jangan fikir begitu.

186
00:10:46,604 --> 00:10:49,566
Saya nak cuba segerakan
dia dapat katil di wad.

187
00:10:49,649 --> 00:10:50,525
Semoga berjaya.

188
00:10:50,608 --> 00:10:51,609
Apa itu?

189
00:10:51,693 --> 00:10:54,154
Pelan untuk koridor.
Ruang makin penuh.

190
00:10:54,237 --> 00:10:56,114
Kes tembakan polis akan sampai.

191
00:10:56,197 --> 00:10:59,450
Ya, tolong baiki VRI itu
secepat mungkin.

192
00:10:59,534 --> 00:11:00,493
Terima kasih.

193
00:11:00,577 --> 00:11:03,204
Santos, tolong kendalikan
beberapa kes Westbridge.

194
00:11:03,288 --> 00:11:05,206
Sudah tentu.
Nak saya buat magik juga?

195
00:11:05,290 --> 00:11:07,250
Mungkin. Pandai menjahit tak?

196
00:11:07,333 --> 00:11:09,169
Leher diintubasi. Saturasi tak baik.

197
00:11:09,252 --> 00:11:11,004
Kami dihantar ke sini. Ada bilik?

198
00:11:11,087 --> 00:11:11,963
Trauma 1.

199
00:11:12,046 --> 00:11:13,464
- Apa jadi?
- Pegawai Hiro

200
00:11:13,548 --> 00:11:16,968
kena tembakan jarak dekat.
Makin susah tekan beg.

201
00:11:17,051 --> 00:11:18,720
Rompakan gudang tak menjadi.

202
00:11:19,762 --> 00:11:21,806
- Satu, dua, tiga.
- Tunggu sini.

203
00:11:21,890 --> 00:11:23,808
Kami janji akan rawat dia.

204
00:11:23,892 --> 00:11:25,643
Ingatkan awak dah pergi cuti.

205
00:11:25,727 --> 00:11:27,270
Tanpa jumpa awak beruniform?

206
00:11:27,353 --> 00:11:28,771
Patut tengok uniform lain saya.

207
00:11:28,855 --> 00:11:29,898
Awak buat intubasi?

208
00:11:29,981 --> 00:11:31,608
Ketika tembak-menembak.

209
00:11:31,691 --> 00:11:32,775
Serius?

210
00:11:32,859 --> 00:11:34,360
Saya ikut jika ada kecederaan.

211
00:11:34,444 --> 00:11:35,486
Beraninya.

212
00:11:35,570 --> 00:11:37,322
Dr. Santos, mari penuhkan oksigen.

213
00:11:37,405 --> 00:11:38,364
Nampak salur nafas?

214
00:11:38,448 --> 00:11:41,034
Ya, tadi, tapi susah
apabila melepasinya.

215
00:11:41,117 --> 00:11:42,911
Saturasi jatuh ke 85.

216
00:11:42,994 --> 00:11:45,371
Dr. Santos, apa punca
kegagalan respirasi

217
00:11:45,455 --> 00:11:46,581
pada pesakit diintubasi?

218
00:11:46,664 --> 00:11:48,124
Banyak kemungkinan.

219
00:11:48,208 --> 00:11:49,292
Fikirkan DOPE.

220
00:11:49,375 --> 00:11:53,004
Teralih, halangan,
pneumotoraks, kegagalan alatan.

221
00:11:53,087 --> 00:11:54,505
Gerak baik. Bukan pneumotoraks.

222
00:11:55,673 --> 00:11:59,552
Maksudnya, teralih.
Okey, trakea terputus.

223
00:12:01,554 --> 00:12:02,680
Tarik keluar.

224
00:12:03,932 --> 00:12:04,933
Beg.

225
00:12:05,016 --> 00:12:07,143
Kalau intubasi, tak tembus keluar?

226
00:12:07,227 --> 00:12:08,770
Ya. Kita guna cara lain.

227
00:12:08,853 --> 00:12:10,271
Ya. Okey.

228
00:12:10,355 --> 00:12:12,607
- Saturasi 83.
- Udara tak masuk.

229
00:12:12,690 --> 00:12:14,817
Okey, ambil topeng neonatal.

230
00:12:14,901 --> 00:12:16,110
- Neonatal?
- Ya.

231
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:19,739
Saya akan selesaikan pemeriksaan.

232
00:12:19,822 --> 00:12:21,574
Beritahu kalau rasa sakit.

233
00:12:25,703 --> 00:12:27,080
Kaki saya okey.

234
00:12:28,289 --> 00:12:29,457
Nampak baik.

235
00:12:30,792 --> 00:12:32,627
Tak perlu X-ray atau imbasan.

236
00:12:32,710 --> 00:12:33,670
Faham.

237
00:12:33,753 --> 00:12:35,046
Dua kesan ekimosis...

238
00:12:35,129 --> 00:12:36,506
Maksudnya, lebam.

239
00:12:36,589 --> 00:12:37,674
...di kedua-dua bahu.

240
00:12:37,757 --> 00:12:39,801
- Saya akan rakam gambar.
- Okey.

241
00:12:39,884 --> 00:12:41,177
Dana akan selesaikan

242
00:12:41,261 --> 00:12:43,513
dan saya ada di ER
jika awak ada soalan.

243
00:12:43,596 --> 00:12:45,890
- Awak akan dijaga.
- Terima kasih.

244
00:12:48,017 --> 00:12:49,269
Okey, Ilana.

245
00:12:50,353 --> 00:12:51,562
Saya baca aduan awak.

246
00:12:52,397 --> 00:12:54,899
Boleh ceritakan apa yang terjadi?

247
00:12:58,027 --> 00:13:01,155
Saya pergi barbeku 4 Julai

248
00:13:02,198 --> 00:13:03,616
dengan beberapa kawan.

249
00:13:04,909 --> 00:13:06,160
Saya sediakan tempat.

250
00:13:15,545 --> 00:13:16,796
Sakit di mana?

251
00:13:16,879 --> 00:13:19,424
<i>Di bawah pusat saya.</i>

252
00:13:20,174 --> 00:13:23,469
Okey. Awak demam,
muntah atau cirit-birit?

253
00:13:24,220 --> 00:13:26,973
<i>Tak, sakit perut saja.</i>

254
00:13:27,056 --> 00:13:29,475
Jumpa jururawat
dan suruh dia hubungi saya.

255
00:13:29,559 --> 00:13:32,437
<i>Okey. Tapi saya tetap
nak aiskrim malam ini.</i>

256
00:13:33,187 --> 00:13:34,897
Kita tengok dulu nanti.

257
00:13:36,024 --> 00:13:38,776
<i>Tak sakit sangat.
Awak janganlah sedih.</i>

258
00:13:38,860 --> 00:13:41,154
Saya tak sedih. Saya okey.

259
00:13:41,237 --> 00:13:43,364
Riak muka awak tak okey.

260
00:13:44,824 --> 00:13:46,868
Awak masih nak tengok
bunga api malam ini?

261
00:13:46,951 --> 00:13:48,077
Saya ada fon telinga...

262
00:13:48,161 --> 00:13:49,704
MAK, SUDAHLAH.

263
00:13:50,204 --> 00:13:51,372
Saya bukan kurang ajar.

264
00:13:51,456 --> 00:13:52,457
Maaf. Letak dulu.

265
00:13:52,540 --> 00:13:54,125
LETAK SAJA DI BILIK SAYA

266
00:13:54,208 --> 00:13:56,794
DAN SAYA AKAN TENGOK SETELAH BALIK.

267
00:13:58,588 --> 00:14:01,299
Elliot Green, 17 tahun,
pengsan semasa latihan.

268
00:14:02,008 --> 00:14:03,801
Saya hanya pening, okey?

269
00:14:03,885 --> 00:14:05,470
Minggu orientasi. Saya kena balik.

270
00:14:05,553 --> 00:14:06,763
Yalah, budak kuat.

271
00:14:06,846 --> 00:14:10,933
A&O, sistolik 95, takikardia 122,
tiada ubat atau alahan.

272
00:14:11,017 --> 00:14:12,643
Berapa lama dalam latihan?

273
00:14:12,727 --> 00:14:15,021
Mula pukul 9.00,
lebih kurang empat jam.

274
00:14:15,104 --> 00:14:17,607
Empat jam dalam cuaca panas
pakai alatan lengkap?

275
00:14:17,690 --> 00:14:19,150
Kena usaha keras.

276
00:14:22,070 --> 00:14:23,696
Aduh, laparnya.

277
00:14:25,865 --> 00:14:29,118
- Hei, bila waktu rehat?
- Tiada rehat di sini.

278
00:14:29,202 --> 00:14:31,371
Sentiasa bawa bar protein,
snek pantas.

279
00:14:32,246 --> 00:14:33,623
Ogilvie, Joy.

280
00:14:34,832 --> 00:14:36,209
Mari sini.

281
00:14:36,292 --> 00:14:40,004
- Pengsan ketika latihan bola.
- Saya perlu minum air saja.

282
00:14:40,713 --> 00:14:42,048
Mungkin strok haba?

283
00:14:42,131 --> 00:14:44,300
Kalau strok haba,
status mental terjejas.

284
00:14:44,384 --> 00:14:45,635
Biasanya tak berpeluh.

285
00:14:45,718 --> 00:14:48,054
Kematian 50%
dalam kalangan orang tua.

286
00:14:48,137 --> 00:14:49,847
Dalam cuaca panas begini...

287
00:14:51,432 --> 00:14:53,476
- Langdon, boleh ambil alih?
- Ya.

288
00:14:53,559 --> 00:14:55,353
En. Diaz. Orlando.

289
00:14:55,436 --> 00:14:58,398
- Nak pergi mana?
- Balik. Boleh cabutkan?

290
00:14:58,481 --> 00:15:01,192
Tak boleh.
Perlu 48 jam untuk DKA pulih.

291
00:15:01,275 --> 00:15:02,944
Darah awak masih berasid.

292
00:15:03,027 --> 00:15:05,947
Saya tak boleh tambah
kepada hutang $100,000 sedia ada.

293
00:15:06,030 --> 00:15:07,698
Maaf. $100.000?

294
00:15:07,782 --> 00:15:09,992
Hutang perubatan.
Isteri saya tak tahu.

295
00:15:10,743 --> 00:15:12,245
Saya memang takkan mampu.

296
00:15:12,328 --> 00:15:14,205
Mana mereka? Kita boleh bincang.

297
00:15:14,288 --> 00:15:15,957
Saya suruh mereka pergi kerja.

298
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:17,792
Hospital dah berikan diskaun.

299
00:15:17,875 --> 00:15:21,504
Saya faham, En. Diaz.
Tapi setidaknya boleh tunggu 12 jam?

300
00:15:21,587 --> 00:15:23,214
Biar lepas zon bahaya dulu.

301
00:15:23,297 --> 00:15:25,425
Saya tak boleh tunggu.

302
00:15:26,008 --> 00:15:28,803
Setiap minit di sini,
saya boleh bayar nafkah rumah.

303
00:15:29,470 --> 00:15:31,722
Kerja kedua saya mula 4.00 petang.

304
00:15:31,806 --> 00:15:34,725
- Awak perlu cecair.
- Saya dah minum banyak air.

305
00:15:34,809 --> 00:15:37,270
Kalium dan insulin. Apa kata begini?

306
00:15:37,353 --> 00:15:39,814
Jangan pergi,
saya akan sediakan bekalan.

307
00:15:39,897 --> 00:15:42,692
Juga rujukan ke Pusat Kesihatan
Christian North Side.

308
00:15:44,235 --> 00:15:46,529
Marilah. Kerja awak
hanya mula pukul 4.00.

309
00:15:46,612 --> 00:15:49,282
Awak takkan pengsan
di tempat kerja lagi

310
00:15:49,365 --> 00:15:50,199
atau lebih teruk.

311
00:15:54,454 --> 00:15:55,538
Okey, rasanya.

312
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:58,458
Bagus. Terima kasih. Mari.

313
00:16:02,378 --> 00:16:04,005
Saturasi naik 98.

314
00:16:04,088 --> 00:16:05,423
Topeng neonatal berhasil.

315
00:16:05,506 --> 00:16:06,757
Santos, selesaikan FAST.

316
00:16:06,841 --> 00:16:08,843
- Awak suntik apa?
- Lido dengan epi.

317
00:16:08,926 --> 00:16:10,678
Pendarahan akan disekat.

318
00:16:10,761 --> 00:16:12,263
Beri jarum cangkuk. Shiley 4?

319
00:16:13,055 --> 00:16:14,599
Saya tak suka guna Shiley.

320
00:16:14,682 --> 00:16:16,142
Tak sangka awak cerewet.

321
00:16:16,225 --> 00:16:19,562
Santos, rehat dulu.
Tolong potong tiub ET, 6mm.

322
00:16:19,645 --> 00:16:21,856
Apa berlaku? Ada petugas lapangan?

323
00:16:21,939 --> 00:16:25,568
Dr. Abbot doktor di sini,
serta doktor SWAT.

324
00:16:25,651 --> 00:16:28,070
Kawan saya, Hiro,
cedera salur pernafasan.

325
00:16:28,154 --> 00:16:29,363
Potong di sini.

326
00:16:29,447 --> 00:16:31,282
- Kami boleh uruskan.
- Tak apa.

327
00:16:31,365 --> 00:16:33,618
- Awak doktor baharu.
- Ya. Dr. Al-Hashimi.

328
00:16:33,701 --> 00:16:36,120
Saya nak salam, tapi perlukan tiub.

329
00:16:36,204 --> 00:16:38,581
Kalau jumpa trakea distal,
kita ada peluang.

330
00:16:38,664 --> 00:16:40,166
Okey, perhatikan saturasi.

331
00:16:42,210 --> 00:16:43,878
Perlahan-lahan.

332
00:16:43,961 --> 00:16:46,380
Kadangkala awak patut hubungi saya.

333
00:16:46,464 --> 00:16:49,008
- Pesakit apa?
- GSW, pecah trakea.

334
00:16:49,091 --> 00:16:52,678
Di belakang,
tapi saya rasa boleh capai.

335
00:16:52,762 --> 00:16:53,679
Peparu naik?

336
00:16:54,388 --> 00:16:56,349
- Saturasi jatuh 91.
- Saya imbas perut.

337
00:16:56,432 --> 00:16:57,767
Okey, sekejap...

338
00:16:59,769 --> 00:17:01,062
Dah jumpa.

339
00:17:04,315 --> 00:17:06,067
Perlahan-lahan.

340
00:17:06,150 --> 00:17:07,151
Turun ke 89.

341
00:17:09,237 --> 00:17:10,404
Masuk. Kembungkan belon.

342
00:17:13,282 --> 00:17:15,076
Tidal hujung, gelombang cantik.

343
00:17:15,826 --> 00:17:17,328
Bunyi nafasnya baik.

344
00:17:18,120 --> 00:17:20,331
Saya akan jahit trakea. Sutera 2-0.

345
00:17:21,582 --> 00:17:24,418
- Saturasi naik.
- Boleh tahan, Abbot.

346
00:17:26,128 --> 00:17:27,838
Semasa awak sibuk di situ,

347
00:17:27,922 --> 00:17:29,840
awak tak perasan lebam besar di sini.

348
00:17:29,924 --> 00:17:31,175
Dia pakai perisai badan.

349
00:17:31,259 --> 00:17:34,178
Projektil laju tak perlu menusuk
untuk mencederakan.

350
00:17:34,720 --> 00:17:36,222
Tiada cecair di suprasplenik.

351
00:17:37,098 --> 00:17:38,099
Biar saya periksa.

352
00:17:39,267 --> 00:17:40,226
Okey, di situ.

353
00:17:42,895 --> 00:17:45,147
Macam hematoma subkapsular
pada limpa.

354
00:17:45,231 --> 00:17:46,232
Mesti impak kuat.

355
00:17:46,315 --> 00:17:49,652
Halaju muncung AR-15
ialah 3,000 kaki sesaat.

356
00:17:49,735 --> 00:17:51,112
Angiogram CT leher segera,

357
00:17:51,195 --> 00:17:53,239
serta CT dada, abdomen dan pelvis.

358
00:17:53,322 --> 00:17:56,325
Ya, sebaik kami selesaikan tiub ini.

359
00:18:00,580 --> 00:18:02,999
- Liter pertama masuk.
- Membran mukus kering.

360
00:18:03,082 --> 00:18:05,167
Anak mata reaktif 4mm.

361
00:18:05,251 --> 00:18:06,711
Awak dijatuhkan hari ini?

362
00:18:06,794 --> 00:18:08,546
Tak, hanya berlari.

363
00:18:08,629 --> 00:18:10,840
- Sakit dada? Jantung berdebar?
- Tak.

364
00:18:10,923 --> 00:18:13,175
Tangan lepas dulu. Saya buat 12-lead.

365
00:18:13,259 --> 00:18:14,510
Bagaimana pesakit?

366
00:18:14,594 --> 00:18:17,305
Baik. Sihat,
tiada sejarah sakit atau trauma.

367
00:18:17,388 --> 00:18:20,349
Diagnosis pembezaan
untuk pengsan pada remaja.

368
00:18:20,433 --> 00:18:22,393
- Aritmia jantung...
- Hipovolemia.

369
00:18:22,476 --> 00:18:24,145
- sawan, sepsis...
- ...QT, WPW...

370
00:18:24,228 --> 00:18:25,271
...atau Brugada.

371
00:18:25,354 --> 00:18:27,523
Brugada lebih biasa pada lelaki Asia.

372
00:18:27,607 --> 00:18:28,983
Masih perlu dipertimbangkan.

373
00:18:29,066 --> 00:18:32,528
Kemungkinan kecil. Prevalens Brugada
1 dalam 20,000 di Amerika Utara,

374
00:18:32,612 --> 00:18:35,114
1 dalam 300 di Asia dan Timur Tengah.

375
00:18:35,197 --> 00:18:37,867
- Lagi?
- Mula ditemui pada 1992.

376
00:18:37,950 --> 00:18:39,744
Risiko kematian mengejut agak tinggi

377
00:18:39,827 --> 00:18:42,121
pada pesakit muda
walaupun jantung normal.

378
00:18:42,705 --> 00:18:44,707
Sekejap. Kematian mengejut?

379
00:18:44,790 --> 00:18:46,292
Suhu badan 39.2°C.

380
00:18:46,375 --> 00:18:49,170
Maaf, doktor pelatih kami
bincang penyakit tak berkaitan.

381
00:18:50,421 --> 00:18:52,423
Saya cuma tak minum air secukupnya.

382
00:18:53,257 --> 00:18:54,383
Badan terlalu panas.

383
00:18:56,469 --> 00:18:57,970
Bukan jenis saya suka.

384
00:18:58,054 --> 00:19:00,890
Selain ujian biasa,
apa lagi patut dibuat?

385
00:19:04,727 --> 00:19:06,437
CK untuk singkirkan rhabdo.

386
00:19:07,104 --> 00:19:09,023
Untuk pastikan otot tak rosak.

387
00:19:09,106 --> 00:19:11,192
Mari sediakan bilik penyejukan

388
00:19:11,275 --> 00:19:14,278
dan hilangkan kesan kepanasan
pada badannya.

389
00:19:18,324 --> 00:19:19,450
Gambar terakhir.

390
00:19:23,954 --> 00:19:26,248
Okey. Kami ambil kad SD

391
00:19:26,957 --> 00:19:29,835
dan simpan di dalam sampul bukti
dengan bahan lain.

392
00:19:30,628 --> 00:19:31,712
Okey.

393
00:19:31,796 --> 00:19:34,256
Sekarang, Emma akan matikan lampu

394
00:19:36,133 --> 00:19:38,094
dan saya periksa badan guna lampu UV.

395
00:19:38,969 --> 00:19:43,933
Kalau ada yang berkilau, saya ambil
sampel basah, kemudian kering.

396
00:19:44,016 --> 00:19:46,102
- Boleh?
- Ya.

397
00:19:49,271 --> 00:19:50,231
Baiklah.

398
00:19:50,314 --> 00:19:52,441
Tanggalkan gaun sebelah kiri,

399
00:19:52,525 --> 00:19:54,610
pusingkan badan ke arah saya sikit.

400
00:19:56,987 --> 00:19:58,239
Ya, di situ.

401
00:20:23,055 --> 00:20:25,391
Ada sesuatu di pergelangan kiri.

402
00:20:33,441 --> 00:20:35,151
- Maaf.
- Tak apa.

403
00:20:35,860 --> 00:20:37,278
- Cuma sejuk.
- Ya.

404
00:20:37,361 --> 00:20:38,821
Hampir selesai.

405
00:20:45,619 --> 00:20:47,705
- Terima kasih, Antoine.
- Sama-sama.

406
00:20:47,788 --> 00:20:49,415
Hati-hati sentiasa.

407
00:20:49,498 --> 00:20:50,499
Bagaimana?

408
00:20:50,583 --> 00:20:52,543
Angio leher negatif.
Tak kena karotid.

409
00:20:53,252 --> 00:20:54,587
- Mujurlah.
- Perutnya pula?

410
00:20:54,670 --> 00:20:57,256
Kecederaan kecil limpa,
tiada cecair di abdomen.

411
00:20:57,339 --> 00:20:59,091
- Boleh pulih.
- Apa rancangannya?

412
00:20:59,175 --> 00:21:01,761
Bilik bedah sedang disediakan
bersama pakar.

413
00:21:01,844 --> 00:21:03,095
Berapa segera?

414
00:21:03,179 --> 00:21:04,930
Kami dipenuhi pesakit Westbridge,

415
00:21:05,014 --> 00:21:06,974
tapi mari bawa naik dulu.
Kami akan uruskan.

416
00:21:09,059 --> 00:21:12,271
Hei, awak akan selamat.
Kami bawa ke bilik bedah.

417
00:21:13,731 --> 00:21:15,399
- Saya akan catatkan.
- Terima kasih.

418
00:21:20,946 --> 00:21:23,699
- SWAT? Betul?
- Tak pandai golf.

419
00:21:24,283 --> 00:21:25,910
Bertugas di Timur Tengah?

420
00:21:26,952 --> 00:21:28,078
Terlalu lama di sana.

421
00:21:28,162 --> 00:21:30,831
Saya bekerja di Kabul
dengan Médecins Sans Frontières.

422
00:21:30,915 --> 00:21:33,167
Tahun 2020 pula,
di hospital bersalin.

423
00:21:33,793 --> 00:21:37,254
Saya kenal ramai doktor
paling hebat dan berani di sana.

424
00:21:37,338 --> 00:21:40,382
Dasht-e-Barchi. Satu tragedi.

425
00:21:42,510 --> 00:21:44,845
Nanti boleh keluar minum,
kongsi cerita lama.

426
00:21:45,638 --> 00:21:46,722
Boleh juga.

427
00:21:50,726 --> 00:21:52,561
- Dia macam hebat.
- Ya, mungkin.

428
00:21:53,479 --> 00:21:55,314
Saya takkan lama untuk tahu.

429
00:21:56,899 --> 00:21:58,234
Itu pun dia. Vic!

430
00:21:59,068 --> 00:22:03,572
- Ayah!
- Victoria, ini Dr. Amy Joon.

431
00:22:03,656 --> 00:22:05,449
Dr. Joon orang paling bijak
saya kenal.

432
00:22:05,533 --> 00:22:07,660
Jangan beritahu mak kamu. Gurau saja.

433
00:22:07,743 --> 00:22:09,161
Serius, jangan.

434
00:22:09,787 --> 00:22:12,081
- Hai.
- Hai. Awak datang jumpa pesakit?

435
00:22:12,164 --> 00:22:14,333
Tak. Kami datang jumpa awak.

436
00:22:14,416 --> 00:22:15,709
Dr. Joon ketua dermatologi.

437
00:22:15,793 --> 00:22:20,214
Syif pertama Victoria di ER
ialah ketika tembakan PittFest.

438
00:22:20,297 --> 00:22:22,341
Saya dengar pelbagai kisah hebat,

439
00:22:22,424 --> 00:22:25,594
termasuk kecekapan awak
sebagai pelajar perubatan.

440
00:22:25,678 --> 00:22:28,264
- Ya.
- Wah, "kecekapan" saya. Itu...

441
00:22:29,181 --> 00:22:31,433
Sejujurnya, saya cuba tak mengganggu.

442
00:22:31,517 --> 00:22:32,977
Dia merendah diri macam ayahnya.

443
00:22:33,060 --> 00:22:34,270
Ibunya pula?

444
00:22:35,354 --> 00:22:36,188
Maaf.

445
00:22:37,022 --> 00:22:38,023
Dr. Joon.

446
00:22:38,983 --> 00:22:39,984
Ya, saya datang.

447
00:22:41,068 --> 00:22:43,028
Saya bantu orang
di pejabat datuk bandar

448
00:22:43,112 --> 00:22:45,990
yang perlu dibedah
kerana karsinoma sel basal.

449
00:22:46,073 --> 00:22:48,117
Kemudian, barbeku untuk 30 orang.

450
00:22:48,200 --> 00:22:49,952
- Wah.
- Selamat 4 Julai.

451
00:22:50,035 --> 00:22:51,328
- Ya.
- Selamat 4 Julai.

452
00:22:51,412 --> 00:22:52,705
- Terima kasih.
- Sama-sama.

453
00:22:53,581 --> 00:22:54,582
Kita minum kopi nanti.

454
00:22:54,665 --> 00:22:56,292
Sudah tentu. Terima kasih.

455
00:22:57,960 --> 00:23:00,337
Ayah tahu mak nak saya
masuk pembedahan.

456
00:23:00,421 --> 00:23:03,382
Mak kamu nak ayah berhenti minum
dan masuk liga bola pikel.

457
00:23:03,465 --> 00:23:05,968
- Samalah sangat.
- Ya. Itu...

458
00:23:06,051 --> 00:23:08,804
Lagi rela koyak Achilles
berbanding berhenti minum.

459
00:23:08,888 --> 00:23:11,390
Hei, harap kamu
tak rasa malu ayah datang.

460
00:23:11,473 --> 00:23:12,308
Tak.

461
00:23:12,391 --> 00:23:15,060
Ayah hanya nak tunjukkan
pilihan residensi lain.

462
00:23:15,728 --> 00:23:18,397
Saya sangat hargainya, ayah. Cuma...

463
00:23:19,690 --> 00:23:20,858
saya masih belum pasti.

464
00:23:21,901 --> 00:23:24,278
Apa-apa pun, pilihan di tangan kamu.

465
00:23:24,904 --> 00:23:26,822
- Ayah bangga.
- Okey.

466
00:23:26,906 --> 00:23:29,408
Dr. Javadi, awak sangat berbakat.

467
00:23:29,491 --> 00:23:31,160
- Ya.
- Itu baru sikit.

468
00:23:31,243 --> 00:23:33,913
Anak awak kena capai
standard yang tinggi.

469
00:23:33,996 --> 00:23:36,415
Itu baru sikit.

470
00:23:39,710 --> 00:23:42,796
En. dan Pn. Davis,
ini Dr. Jefferson dari Psikiatri.

471
00:23:42,880 --> 00:23:44,340
Panggil saya Caleb.

472
00:23:45,215 --> 00:23:47,551
Boleh beritahu tentang anak kami?

473
00:23:47,635 --> 00:23:51,221
Semua ujian dan X-raynya normal.

474
00:23:51,305 --> 00:23:54,308
Memandangkan umur dan aduan
dia mendengar suara...

475
00:23:55,184 --> 00:23:58,395
Antara kamu,
ada sejarah keluarga penyakit mental?

476
00:23:59,813 --> 00:24:00,689
Saya tiada.

477
00:24:07,821 --> 00:24:09,323
Abang saya bunuh diri.

478
00:24:09,406 --> 00:24:10,449
Tunggu. Apa?

479
00:24:11,867 --> 00:24:12,868
Pak Cik Ken?

480
00:24:14,328 --> 00:24:16,622
Ayah kata dia mati
sebab banyak minum. Mak.

481
00:24:16,705 --> 00:24:17,706
Itu betul juga.

482
00:24:17,790 --> 00:24:20,084
Adakah dia pernah didiagnosis?

483
00:24:20,167 --> 00:24:23,462
Tak. Dia murung,
angin berubah-ubah...

484
00:24:24,880 --> 00:24:26,507
- tapi tak nak dirawat.
- Oh, Tuhan.

485
00:24:26,590 --> 00:24:28,550
Okey. Kenapa baru cakap sekarang?

486
00:24:28,634 --> 00:24:30,970
- Tolonglah, Jada.
- Apa, mak?

487
00:24:31,053 --> 00:24:33,222
Kenapa tak beritahu
Jackson atau saya?

488
00:24:34,181 --> 00:24:35,557
Biar betul.

489
00:24:35,641 --> 00:24:36,976
- Jada.
- Maaf.

490
00:24:37,059 --> 00:24:37,893
Jada.

491
00:24:45,943 --> 00:24:46,944
Apa seterusnya?

492
00:24:48,028 --> 00:24:50,114
Anak kamu akan dipantau
selama tiga hari

493
00:24:50,197 --> 00:24:52,199
untuk pemerhatian dan terapi

494
00:24:52,282 --> 00:24:54,660
untuk faham keadaannya.

495
00:24:54,743 --> 00:24:55,911
Jada perlu dengar.

496
00:24:55,995 --> 00:24:58,163
Biar saya cuba pujuk dia.

497
00:25:01,834 --> 00:25:04,211
Okey. Saya akan buat swab mulut.

498
00:25:04,294 --> 00:25:05,212
Mulut saya?

499
00:25:06,005 --> 00:25:09,133
Dua swab kering di dalam pipi,

500
00:25:10,009 --> 00:25:11,552
kemudian pada gusi.

501
00:25:15,764 --> 00:25:17,349
Bagaimana awak rasa?

502
00:25:19,226 --> 00:25:20,769
Saya harap hari ini tak terjadi.

503
00:25:21,520 --> 00:25:23,355
Awak nak ubat untuk rasa tenang?

504
00:25:23,439 --> 00:25:25,232
Awak baru melalui trauma.

505
00:25:28,318 --> 00:25:29,319
Awak dah biasa buat?

506
00:25:30,029 --> 00:25:32,698
Anggap saja saya
dan Florence Nightingale kenal lama.

507
00:25:33,490 --> 00:25:34,533
Siapa?

508
00:25:35,909 --> 00:25:37,494
Tak apalah.

509
00:25:37,578 --> 00:25:39,496
Dia pengasas kejururawatan moden.

510
00:25:41,915 --> 00:25:44,001
Okey. Awak dah boleh makan dan minum.

511
00:25:44,084 --> 00:25:45,127
Tak apa.

512
00:25:45,210 --> 00:25:47,129
- Betul?
- Teruskan saja.

513
00:25:48,338 --> 00:25:49,590
Okey.

514
00:25:56,764 --> 00:26:00,559
Kita ada kes lesu haba di Utara 5.

515
00:26:01,435 --> 00:26:03,812
Penyejukan penyejatan.
Pelan yang bagus.

516
00:26:03,896 --> 00:26:06,774
Ya, idea Dr. Langdon.

517
00:26:08,776 --> 00:26:11,278
Katanya lebih ramai pesakit
akibat haba akan datang.

518
00:26:12,654 --> 00:26:15,407
Betul. Awak bagaimana?

519
00:26:16,658 --> 00:26:17,868
Soalan yang berat.

520
00:26:17,951 --> 00:26:19,411
Tak berniat begitu.

521
00:26:20,621 --> 00:26:22,247
Deposisi awak tak lama lagi.

522
00:26:22,331 --> 00:26:23,582
- Ya.
- Apa perasaan awak?

523
00:26:25,292 --> 00:26:28,462
Saya cuba fikir positif,
tapi tak dapat rasa begitu.

524
00:26:29,963 --> 00:26:31,924
Kerja ini penting
untuk saya dan adik.

525
00:26:32,007 --> 00:26:33,425
Untuk sara kami berdua.

526
00:26:33,509 --> 00:26:34,551
Awak pasti baik.

527
00:26:34,635 --> 00:26:36,720
Beritahu apa yang berlaku.
Awak tak salah.

528
00:26:36,804 --> 00:26:37,888
Kerjaya awak selamat.

529
00:26:37,971 --> 00:26:40,140
Peguam cakap saya mungkin...

530
00:26:40,224 --> 00:26:42,142
Tugas mereka adalah buat awak goyah.

531
00:26:42,226 --> 00:26:44,144
Jangan biar. Awak doktor yang baik.

532
00:26:44,937 --> 00:26:47,940
Saya dah lama latih residen.
Awak antara yang terbaik.

533
00:26:49,191 --> 00:26:50,067
Betul?

534
00:26:50,150 --> 00:26:52,194
Kita perlu ikut rancangan.

535
00:26:52,277 --> 00:26:53,654
- Betul.
- Terima kasih.

536
00:26:53,737 --> 00:26:55,364
Dia tak fikir dengan jelas.

537
00:26:55,447 --> 00:26:56,406
Pasti baik saja.

538
00:26:56,490 --> 00:26:57,991
Itu bukan kehendak dia.

539
00:26:58,075 --> 00:26:59,827
Saya tetap nak bawa dia balik.

540
00:26:59,910 --> 00:27:01,995
Kita perlu hormat permintaan dia.

541
00:27:02,079 --> 00:27:04,331
Walaupun dia tak dapat fikir
dengan baik?

542
00:27:04,414 --> 00:27:06,333
Lebih-lebih lagi. Helo.

543
00:27:06,416 --> 00:27:08,794
Paul Hamler,
ini ketua saya, Dr. Robinavitch.

544
00:27:08,877 --> 00:27:12,589
- Hai.
- Isteri saya tak fikir dengan jelas.

545
00:27:12,673 --> 00:27:15,259
Apa permintaan dia?

546
00:27:15,342 --> 00:27:16,885
Dia nak tinggal di hospital.

547
00:27:17,636 --> 00:27:19,096
Mari kita masuk dan bincang.

548
00:27:20,848 --> 00:27:24,309
Brian Jenkins boleh memburu
guna pistol .22 di ladang datuknya.

549
00:27:24,393 --> 00:27:26,562
Macam bahaya saja.

550
00:27:26,645 --> 00:27:28,856
Kamu pula bukan Brian Jenkins.

551
00:27:28,939 --> 00:27:30,691
Bagaimana semuanya, Roxie?

552
00:27:31,567 --> 00:27:32,860
Dulu lebih baik.

553
00:27:32,943 --> 00:27:35,779
Kami dengar yang awak
tetap mahu masuk wad?

554
00:27:37,447 --> 00:27:38,699
Tak nak balik sekarang.

555
00:27:39,908 --> 00:27:42,911
Semua dah sedia, Rox.
Lebih selesa di rumah.

556
00:27:42,995 --> 00:27:44,496
Paul, saya ubah fikiran.

557
00:27:45,330 --> 00:27:46,456
Itu rumah kita.

558
00:27:48,709 --> 00:27:49,710
Saya tak nak...

559
00:27:50,627 --> 00:27:52,337
Tak nak awak hidup dengan hantu saya.

560
00:27:52,421 --> 00:27:54,381
Saya gembira saja.

561
00:27:54,464 --> 00:27:57,801
Boleh berhenti cakap pasal hantu?

562
00:27:57,885 --> 00:28:00,554
Ya. Maaf, sayang. Betul cakap kamu.

563
00:28:02,014 --> 00:28:03,807
Kes trauma akan tiba. Lima minit.

564
00:28:03,891 --> 00:28:07,227
Okey. Maaf, saya akan kembali.

565
00:28:07,311 --> 00:28:08,395
Saya minta diri.

566
00:28:10,189 --> 00:28:12,482
Kemalangan bot.
Mangsa kena kipas enjin.

567
00:28:12,566 --> 00:28:15,277
- Aduh. Kena bahagian apa?
- Mereka tak cakap.

568
00:28:15,360 --> 00:28:16,904
- Umur?
- Tak tahu.

569
00:28:16,987 --> 00:28:17,905
Ada apa-apa lagi?

570
00:28:17,988 --> 00:28:20,199
Hanya "kemalangan bot, kipas enjin".

571
00:28:20,282 --> 00:28:21,617
Kipas enjin. Baiklah.

572
00:28:25,329 --> 00:28:29,750
Trauma Tahap 1.
Jangka masa tiba, dua minit.

573
00:28:52,481 --> 00:28:54,483
Saya pilih hari yang teruk
untuk kembali.

574
00:28:55,776 --> 00:28:56,860
Apa khabar Jake?

575
00:28:58,654 --> 00:29:02,032
Dia baik. Jauh lebih baik sekarang.

576
00:29:02,824 --> 00:29:04,701
Sudah tahun senior musim luruh ini.

577
00:29:04,785 --> 00:29:05,827
Baguslah.

578
00:29:07,246 --> 00:29:08,830
Berat beban yang dia tanggung.

579
00:29:10,457 --> 00:29:12,292
Begitu juga ramai orang.

580
00:29:12,834 --> 00:29:13,752
Ya.

581
00:29:15,587 --> 00:29:16,880
Okey, saya tetap nak cakap.

582
00:29:17,839 --> 00:29:19,258
Saya minta maaf.

583
00:29:19,341 --> 00:29:20,634
Saya khianati awak.

584
00:29:20,717 --> 00:29:22,636
Khianati kepercayaan pesakit.

585
00:29:22,719 --> 00:29:25,847
Saya sangat kesal
dan sumpah ia takkan berulang.

586
00:29:30,727 --> 00:29:33,063
Saya gembira awak dapatkan bantuan.

587
00:29:36,942 --> 00:29:39,278
Cuma tak pasti nak awak
bekerja di kecemasan.

588
00:29:48,662 --> 00:29:50,956
- Kenapa intubasi?
- Dia menjerit kesakitan.

589
00:29:51,039 --> 00:29:52,666
Nafas hampir tiada, oksigen 80.

590
00:29:52,749 --> 00:29:54,209
Bagaimana kena kipas enjin?

591
00:29:54,293 --> 00:29:57,129
Dia di Sungai Allegheny,
cuba leraikan tali ski air

592
00:29:57,212 --> 00:29:58,422
dan kawan hidupkan enjin.

593
00:29:58,505 --> 00:30:00,799
- Kawannya mabuk?
- 4 Julai. Semestinya.

594
00:30:00,882 --> 00:30:02,134
Tolong fokus pada pesakit.

595
00:30:02,217 --> 00:30:03,468
Sofie, picit beg.

596
00:30:06,346 --> 00:30:09,308
Okey. Satu, dua, tiga.
Jaga-jaga pelekap.

597
00:30:11,143 --> 00:30:12,269
- Saya diperlukan?
- Tak.

598
00:30:12,352 --> 00:30:15,022
Dah ada residen senior dan penyelia.

599
00:30:15,105 --> 00:30:17,858
- Mel, boleh mula dengan...
- EFAST? Ya.

600
00:30:17,941 --> 00:30:19,693
- Ya.
- Kenapa?

601
00:30:19,776 --> 00:30:21,945
Untuk pastikan tiada pneumotoraks.

602
00:30:22,029 --> 00:30:23,405
Kalau tak, boleh jadi tegang.

603
00:30:23,488 --> 00:30:24,531
Betul.

604
00:30:26,241 --> 00:30:28,285
- Nak O-negatif?
- Periksa tekanan darah.

605
00:30:28,368 --> 00:30:32,289
108/64. Nadi 102.
Saturasi oksigen baik.

606
00:30:32,372 --> 00:30:35,667
Baik, sediakan O-negatif,
tapi jangan beri dulu.

607
00:30:35,751 --> 00:30:36,752
Ada lagi?

608
00:30:39,212 --> 00:30:40,547
Bagaimana dengan HemoCue?

609
00:30:40,630 --> 00:30:42,382
Ya, sudah tentu.

610
00:30:50,766 --> 00:30:52,309
Seterusnya, kuku.

611
00:30:54,353 --> 00:30:55,937
Pada setiap kuku,

612
00:30:56,605 --> 00:30:59,566
mula dengan swab basah,
kemudian kering.

613
00:31:01,109 --> 00:31:02,652
Awak nak rehat sekejap?

614
00:31:03,695 --> 00:31:04,696
Tak.

615
00:31:05,947 --> 00:31:06,865
Okey.

616
00:31:10,410 --> 00:31:11,411
Berapa lama lagi?

617
00:31:11,495 --> 00:31:15,791
Selepas ini, kita ambil
sampel luar dan dalam faraj.

618
00:31:20,087 --> 00:31:23,006
- Wakil PAAR datang.
- Okey.

619
00:31:23,757 --> 00:31:25,300
Mereka lebih lama buat kerja ini.

620
00:31:25,384 --> 00:31:29,221
Mereka beri sumber, bantuan
dan sokongan kepada mangsa.

621
00:31:31,515 --> 00:31:32,557
Hei.

622
00:31:34,559 --> 00:31:36,186
Hal ini tak membentuk diri awak.

623
00:31:36,937 --> 00:31:40,524
Tak perlu cakap dengan mereka,
tapi saya sarankannya.

624
00:31:40,607 --> 00:31:42,401
Mereka sentiasa ada.

625
00:31:44,319 --> 00:31:46,405
- Okey.
- Okey.

626
00:31:52,994 --> 00:31:56,665
Hai. Saya Paulette Sanderson,
dari Gerakan Antirogol Pittsburgh.

627
00:31:57,290 --> 00:32:00,210
Hai, Paulette. Saya SANE, Dana.
Ini pula Ilana.

628
00:32:00,293 --> 00:32:03,422
Hai. Maaf kita berjumpa
dalam keadaan begini,

629
00:32:03,505 --> 00:32:05,757
tapi kami datang
untuk bantu awak hadapi

630
00:32:05,841 --> 00:32:07,676
apa-apa selepas ini.

631
00:32:07,759 --> 00:32:10,720
Saya bawa pakaian
dan barang keperluan asas.

632
00:32:10,804 --> 00:32:14,015
Saya boleh teman awak
ketika ujian ini jika awak mahu.

633
00:32:16,435 --> 00:32:18,103
Saya rasa tak perlu.

634
00:32:18,186 --> 00:32:19,271
Okey.

635
00:32:20,147 --> 00:32:23,233
Tak apa. Boleh saya tanya
beberapa soalan?

636
00:32:34,244 --> 00:32:35,120
Ya.

637
00:32:37,914 --> 00:32:39,708
Mesin VRI tak berfungsi.

638
00:32:41,126 --> 00:32:42,752
Jurubahasa Video Geganti?

639
00:32:43,795 --> 00:32:45,172
Saya dah hidupkan balik.

640
00:32:45,255 --> 00:32:47,716
Macam mana awak nak baiki
kalau tak tahu apa bendanya?

641
00:32:49,092 --> 00:32:50,552
Okey, apa-apalah.

642
00:32:51,303 --> 00:32:53,180
Saya nak imbas kepala
dan perut Harlow.

643
00:32:53,263 --> 00:32:54,473
Boleh cuba beritahu dia?

644
00:32:54,556 --> 00:32:56,558
- Bagaimana dengan VRI?
- Dah rosak.

645
00:32:57,767 --> 00:33:00,604
Saya siapkan catatan
setiap kali ada masa.

646
00:33:00,687 --> 00:33:04,065
Saya tak datang untuk itu.
Bagus untuk kes trauma tadi.

647
00:33:07,402 --> 00:33:08,403
Kes apa?

648
00:33:08,487 --> 00:33:11,573
Daniel Scott, 32 tahun,
lemah dan pening semasa cuci kereta.

649
00:33:11,656 --> 00:33:15,285
Takikardia 106, 90/60,
suhu badan terlalu tinggi.

650
00:33:15,869 --> 00:33:17,496
Ada bilik sejuk di Utara 5.

651
00:33:17,579 --> 00:33:19,581
- Awak okey, En. Scott?
- Dahaga.

652
00:33:19,664 --> 00:33:22,918
Kami akan cuba rawat.
Dapatkan suhu teras, CMP...

653
00:33:23,001 --> 00:33:25,629
- Kami perlukan bilik. Yang mana?
- Dua.

654
00:33:25,712 --> 00:33:27,255
Saya ambilkan Ativan.

655
00:33:27,339 --> 00:33:29,508
- Sejarah perubatan?
- Isterinya kata dia sihat.

656
00:33:29,591 --> 00:33:30,800
Tiada ubat atau alahan.

657
00:33:30,884 --> 00:33:32,385
Periksa suhu terasnya.

658
00:33:37,641 --> 00:33:38,683
Sedia untuk angkat.

659
00:33:39,309 --> 00:33:41,770
Berikan dua Ativan.
Untuk elak dia sawan.

660
00:33:41,853 --> 00:33:43,021
Saya perlu kembali.

661
00:33:43,104 --> 00:33:45,732
- Okey.
- Satu, dua, tiga.

662
00:33:47,275 --> 00:33:50,111
- Arahan?
- IV kedua, salina terbuka.

663
00:33:50,195 --> 00:33:53,490
Panel sepsis, UA,
ujian dadah urin, EKG dan CK.

664
00:33:53,573 --> 00:33:55,367
Saya tak nampak kesan trauma.

665
00:33:57,118 --> 00:34:00,497
- Anak mata reaktif.
- En. Scott? Daniel, boleh bercakap?

666
00:34:01,164 --> 00:34:02,999
Pascakejang,
tapi anggota masih gerak.

667
00:34:03,083 --> 00:34:05,168
Nadi 137, tekanan darah 88/60.

668
00:34:05,252 --> 00:34:06,670
Apa pendapat awak, Dr. Santos?

669
00:34:07,546 --> 00:34:09,464
Strok haba, sepsis atau dadah.

670
00:34:13,051 --> 00:34:16,429
Suhu rektal 104.6.

671
00:34:16,513 --> 00:34:20,308
Baik, mulakan dengan empat pek ais
di pangkal paha dan ketiak.

672
00:34:20,392 --> 00:34:22,352
Patut buat mandian ais?

673
00:34:22,435 --> 00:34:23,853
Terlalu lambat. Ada Artic Sun?

674
00:34:23,937 --> 00:34:24,771
Ya, ada.

675
00:34:24,854 --> 00:34:27,190
Pad pada dada, abdomen, kaki.
Saya akan kembali.

676
00:34:30,110 --> 00:34:33,488
Ceftazidime diberi
dan hemoglobin awal 8.2.

677
00:34:33,572 --> 00:34:36,241
Lapan agak rendah.
Mesti turun daripada 14.

678
00:34:36,324 --> 00:34:37,659
Langkah seterusnya?

679
00:34:38,618 --> 00:34:40,745
Pesakit muda dan sihat.
Transfusi apabila 7.

680
00:34:40,829 --> 00:34:41,663
Betul?

681
00:34:42,581 --> 00:34:45,083
Susah jika berlaku
keseimbangan semula.

682
00:34:45,166 --> 00:34:46,293
Saya mengganggu?

683
00:34:46,376 --> 00:34:48,503
- Luka berganda...
- Kipas bot...

684
00:34:51,464 --> 00:34:54,593
Demi Tuhan. Macam digigit dinosaur.

685
00:34:54,676 --> 00:34:56,678
Itu diagnosis rasmi awak?

686
00:34:56,761 --> 00:34:58,179
Pesakit stabil hemodinamik.

687
00:34:58,263 --> 00:34:59,431
Apa lagi?

688
00:35:01,308 --> 00:35:04,352
Intubasi di lapangan
kerana isi padu tidal rendah.

689
00:35:04,436 --> 00:35:08,398
EFAST negatif untuk pneumotoraks,
tak perlu tiub dada.

690
00:35:09,232 --> 00:35:11,776
Tiada bendalir di abdomen.

691
00:35:11,860 --> 00:35:14,487
Hemostasis baik di dalam luka.
Tiada luka arteri.

692
00:35:14,571 --> 00:35:16,656
Mulanya hemoglobin 8.2.

693
00:35:16,740 --> 00:35:18,116
Kita pantau lagi.

694
00:35:18,199 --> 00:35:20,744
Tiada pendarahan aktif.
Jangan transfusi dulu.

695
00:35:23,288 --> 00:35:24,623
Dr. Langdon setuju.

696
00:35:25,248 --> 00:35:26,416
Mari buat CT.

697
00:35:27,584 --> 00:35:30,587
Jason Stills, 62 tahun,
berkumpul untuk buat salad

698
00:35:30,670 --> 00:35:33,632
semasa rasa pening dan loya.
Muntah satu kali.

699
00:35:33,715 --> 00:35:36,426
- Awak bagaimana, En. Stills?
- Rasa nak mati.

700
00:35:36,509 --> 00:35:38,678
Awak datang ke tempat yang betul.

701
00:35:38,762 --> 00:35:40,847
Boleh saya periksa abdomen?

702
00:35:40,930 --> 00:35:42,140
Ya.

703
00:35:42,974 --> 00:35:45,352
- Rasa sakit?
- Tak.

704
00:35:45,435 --> 00:35:48,605
Takidardia 124, suhu 102.4.

705
00:35:48,688 --> 00:35:50,106
Joy, cadangan awak?

706
00:35:50,815 --> 00:35:53,276
Hidrasi, periksa elektrolit,
pindahkan ke bilik sejuk.

707
00:35:53,360 --> 00:35:55,654
Tepat sekali. Semoga ada tempat.

708
00:35:55,737 --> 00:35:56,780
Utara 5.

709
00:35:56,863 --> 00:35:58,490
Apa? Tiada valet?

710
00:36:02,827 --> 00:36:06,790
Jada. Hei, puas saya cari awak.

711
00:36:06,873 --> 00:36:08,375
Saya ambil angin kejap.

712
00:36:08,458 --> 00:36:10,502
Saya nak cakap dengan awak.

713
00:36:13,254 --> 00:36:15,048
Begitu juga Dr. Jefferson.

714
00:36:15,131 --> 00:36:17,467
Penting untuk awak
dengar daripadanya.

715
00:36:17,550 --> 00:36:20,303
Kenapa? Dia tak nak
saya jadi gila macam adik saya?

716
00:36:21,054 --> 00:36:22,806
Atau bunuh diri macam pak cik?

717
00:36:23,890 --> 00:36:25,642
Bukan. Itu...

718
00:36:26,267 --> 00:36:29,813
Kami belum tahu
punca Jackson mengamuk.

719
00:36:29,896 --> 00:36:32,065
"Mengamuk." Okey.

720
00:36:33,900 --> 00:36:37,320
Beginilah, saya tahu
awak pasti takut.

721
00:36:38,071 --> 00:36:40,573
Awak pasti rasa dikhianati
oleh ibu bapa.

722
00:36:41,533 --> 00:36:43,868
Tapi mereka tak tahu
Jackson akan mengalaminya.

723
00:36:44,577 --> 00:36:46,663
Kadangkala keluarga susah untuk

724
00:36:46,746 --> 00:36:48,164
cakap tentang kesihatan mental.

725
00:36:50,333 --> 00:36:52,168
Sekarang, awak boleh bantu

726
00:36:52,252 --> 00:36:54,421
kami ketahui apa yang boleh dibuat.

727
00:37:01,219 --> 00:37:03,847
En. Diaz! Saya ada kejutan!

728
00:37:08,059 --> 00:37:09,978
- Maaf.
- Tak apa.

729
00:37:10,061 --> 00:37:12,313
Awak nampak pesakit saya?

730
00:37:12,397 --> 00:37:14,149
Orlando? En. Diaz?

731
00:37:15,150 --> 00:37:16,276
Bilik ini kosong.

732
00:37:17,610 --> 00:37:19,529
- Serius?
- Ya.

733
00:37:25,076 --> 00:37:26,453
Kenapa dengan awak?

734
00:37:28,455 --> 00:37:29,789
Peluru geser ves saya.

735
00:37:29,873 --> 00:37:31,833
- Awak ditembak?
- Disasarkan.

736
00:37:32,709 --> 00:37:35,420
Penyangak itu rasa hari ini
terbaik untuk merompak.

737
00:37:36,463 --> 00:37:38,590
Tak fikir berapa lama
untuk muatkan barangnya.

738
00:37:38,673 --> 00:37:41,092
Mereka panik. Habis kecoh.

739
00:37:41,176 --> 00:37:42,385
Demi Tuhan.

740
00:37:45,305 --> 00:37:46,347
Kenapa awak buat?

741
00:37:47,390 --> 00:37:49,267
Pakar terapi kata saya perlukan hobi.

742
00:37:49,350 --> 00:37:50,351
Kelakarnya.

743
00:37:52,645 --> 00:37:55,231
Celaka betul. Tak guna.

744
00:37:55,315 --> 00:37:56,983
- Tak apa.
- Bukan...

745
00:37:57,066 --> 00:37:58,610
Jangan risau pasal saya.

746
00:37:58,693 --> 00:38:00,528
Tak, pesakit saya.

747
00:38:00,612 --> 00:38:02,322
Dia tiada insurans

748
00:38:02,405 --> 00:38:05,366
dan dah banyak
tanggung hutang perubatan.

749
00:38:06,951 --> 00:38:08,411
Dia tak mampu bayar ubat.

750
00:38:11,039 --> 00:38:12,332
Apa di dalam beg itu?

751
00:38:12,415 --> 00:38:15,752
Insulin, jalur ujian,
serbuk elektrolit.

752
00:38:17,545 --> 00:38:20,006
Saya dapatkannya
untuk bekalan di rumah.

753
00:38:20,089 --> 00:38:21,591
Hantar guna Uber ke rumahnya.

754
00:38:22,425 --> 00:38:23,802
Hospital akan bayar.

755
00:38:24,803 --> 00:38:25,970
Saya akan bayarkan.

756
00:38:36,773 --> 00:38:38,107
Apa awak buat?

757
00:38:39,067 --> 00:38:40,401
Yang awak tak dapat buat.

758
00:38:41,778 --> 00:38:42,904
Dah catat?

759
00:38:43,530 --> 00:38:46,324
Tak. Tak perlu buat.

760
00:38:46,407 --> 00:38:49,285
Saya tak nak catatan hospital
atau jabatan polis.

761
00:38:49,994 --> 00:38:50,829
Okey.

762
00:38:52,497 --> 00:38:53,665
Rahsia kita.

763
00:38:57,293 --> 00:38:59,629
Bagaimana? Ada sawan lagi?

764
00:38:59,712 --> 00:39:00,755
Tiada.

765
00:39:00,839 --> 00:39:02,257
Suhu 102.9.

766
00:39:02,340 --> 00:39:03,508
Keputusan makmal?

767
00:39:03,591 --> 00:39:05,301
Tanda-tanda dehidrasi.

768
00:39:05,385 --> 00:39:08,972
Sedikit hipernatremia,
BUN ringan dan kreatinin meningkat.

769
00:39:09,055 --> 00:39:11,432
CK sekitar 400. Belum membimbangkan.

770
00:39:11,516 --> 00:39:12,892
Teruskan penyejukan.

771
00:39:12,976 --> 00:39:14,477
Saya akan pantau dia.

772
00:39:14,561 --> 00:39:17,772
Bagus. Dr. Santos
dapat siapkan catatannya.

773
00:39:21,568 --> 00:39:24,070
Tahun kedua residensi
memang mencabar.

774
00:39:24,153 --> 00:39:25,655
Awak perlu gigih.

775
00:39:26,990 --> 00:39:28,992
Apa pelan untuk En. Scott?

776
00:39:29,075 --> 00:39:30,618
Hantar ke ICU.

777
00:39:31,286 --> 00:39:33,329
Patut minta rundingan Neurologi.

778
00:39:33,413 --> 00:39:34,455
Ya, baik.

779
00:39:34,539 --> 00:39:37,125
Disebabkan pesakit muda,
penyakit haba ini,

780
00:39:37,208 --> 00:39:38,710
kadar kematiannya rendah.

781
00:39:38,793 --> 00:39:42,922
Jika pesakit tua, awak perlu risau.

782
00:39:43,006 --> 00:39:46,050
Okey. Saya akan ulang ujian.

783
00:39:46,885 --> 00:39:48,094
Awak bagus tadi.

784
00:40:01,983 --> 00:40:06,070
Pesakit wanita 49 tahun
dihantar ke kecemasan...

785
00:40:09,741 --> 00:40:12,785
dengan aduan sakit telinga kanan...

786
00:40:13,953 --> 00:40:16,289
Donnie, boleh awak tengokkan?

787
00:40:16,372 --> 00:40:17,373
Apa?

788
00:40:18,082 --> 00:40:20,501
Serius? Awak tak rasa rimas?

789
00:40:21,669 --> 00:40:23,254
Bayi itu tak berhenti menangis.

790
00:40:23,338 --> 00:40:25,340
Itu? Saya suka mendengarnya.

791
00:40:25,423 --> 00:40:27,425
- Jesse jururawatnya.
- Tak bolehkah...

792
00:40:35,475 --> 00:40:36,517
Celaka.

793
00:40:42,315 --> 00:40:44,067
Apa yang berlaku?

794
00:40:44,150 --> 00:40:45,318
Dengan apa?

795
00:40:46,569 --> 00:40:49,614
Bayi itulah. Tak boleh hentikannya?

796
00:40:49,697 --> 00:40:52,492
Dah diberi susu dan tukar lampin.
Meragam sebab rhinovirus.

797
00:40:54,285 --> 00:40:56,537
Awak tak boleh buat apa-apa?

798
00:40:56,621 --> 00:40:58,247
Dia perlu diberi Tylenol.

799
00:40:59,332 --> 00:41:00,583
Sekejap. Saya akan kembali.

800
00:41:00,667 --> 00:41:02,710
Tak boleh. Saya tak nak jaga.

801
00:41:05,838 --> 00:41:07,256
Apa masalah kamu?

802
00:41:10,134 --> 00:41:13,012
Sebab inilah
saya tak minat pediatrik.

803
00:41:14,764 --> 00:41:17,225
Okey. Hei.

804
00:41:17,767 --> 00:41:20,520
Hei, Adik Ceria.

805
00:41:22,397 --> 00:41:24,649
Masa untuk tidur kejap?

806
00:41:24,732 --> 00:41:28,027
Seronok kalau boleh. Betul.

807
